# =============================================================================
# Production env — LIVE credentials (same as .env.render). Rotate when you can.
# =============================================================================
# QUICK STEPS
#   1) Commit model files: models/fraud/*, backend/app/ml/models/care_intent_model.joblib,
#      optionally models/care/care_intent_model.joblib — then git push.
#   2) Backend service: PYTHON_VERSION=3.12.6, paste env from this file into Render.
#   3) Frontend: VITE_API_URL=https://<backend>.onrender.com
#   4) Backend CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://<frontend>.onrender.com (replace YOUR_FRONTEND placeholder)
#   5) GGUF optional — MODEL_PATH vs models/llm/<filename>
# =============================================================================

